# Mnemo Cursor Rule

The canonical cross-agent instructions live in @AGENTS.md.

Before making non-trivial changes, read:
- @AGENTS.md
- the linked GitHub Issue in full
- @docs/architecture.md
- @docs/decisions/README.md
- @docs/product-requirements.md
- @docs/roadmap.md
- @docs/project-status.md
- @docs/development-workflow.md

Follow the source-of-truth order in @AGENTS.md. Do not duplicate architecture
or product rules in this Cursor-only file. Put durable changes in the shared
repository documentation so Cursor, Codex, and future agents receive the same
context.
